title: "Quantifying and mitigating explanation drift under INT8 quantization in plant disease image classification"
abstract: "Code, result tables and figures for a study of how INT8 post-training and quantization-aware quantization affect Grad-CAM, Grad-CAM++, LIME and Integrated Gradients attributions across EfficientNetV2-S, ResNet-50 and MobileNetV3-Large on the Paddy Doctor dataset."
